{"title":"Career Roadmap · Cultural Program Coordinator","role":"Cultural Program Coordinator","summary":"A Cultural Program Coordinator plans, organizes and executes cultural programmes involving dance, music, theatre, literature, visual arts, heritage and community events.","facts":{"Current degree":"BPA (Bachelor of Performing Arts)","Course":"Classical Dance (Bharatanatyam, Kuchipudi, Kathak, Odissi, etc.)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Cultural Program Coordinator plans, organizes and executes cultural programmes involving dance, music, theatre, literature, visual arts, heritage and community events."},{"type":"p","text":"For a classical-dance graduate, this career combines performing-arts expertise + event management + cultural programming + artist coordination + communication."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical workplaces include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"Performing-arts organizations"},{"text":"Universities and colleges"},{"text":"Schools"},{"text":"Museums and heritage organizations"},{"text":"Arts foundations"},{"text":"Government cultural bodies"},{"text":"Festivals"},{"text":"Corporate cultural programmes"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Event-management organizations"},{"text":"Tourism and destination-cultural programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cultural programme planning"},{"text":"Artist coordination"},{"text":"Event scheduling"},{"text":"Venue coordination"},{"text":"Stage and technical coordination"},{"text":"Artist hospitality"},{"text":"Rehearsal scheduling"},{"text":"Audience management"},{"text":"Publicity and communication"},{"text":"Sponsorship coordination"},{"text":"Cultural documentation"},{"text":"Budget tracking"},{"text":"Volunteer coordination"},{"text":"Post-event reporting"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","ite